  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#commit-a-navigate-event step 11 (cleaning up a method tracker) is now always executed, while before https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11952 it was only executed in \"otherwise, if not null\".\n\nWhile \"if not null\" can be removed, the removal of \"otherwise\" was a regression - the cleaning up of the method tracker should only be done inside an \"otherwise\", when the navigation is cross document.\n",
